extends website_template

block header_content
  title ETF Composite
  link(rel="stylesheet", type="text/css", href="/stylesheets/map.css")
  
block body_content
  .no-masthead &nbsp;
  .main_content.composite_page.product_page
    h1 ETF Composite
    p The FORESIDE ETF Composite™ Index has been created to provide investors with a product allowing them to track US ETFs. The Index uses an equal weighted allocation across the constituents. Index components are reviewed semi-annually for eligibility, and the weights are re-set according to that distribution. 

    h3 Component Eligibility Requirements

    p All of the following requirements must be met in order for a security to be eligible for inclusion:
    ol
      li The component security must be an Exchange Traded Fund listed in the US.
      li The component security must not be an Exchange Traded Note.
      li The component security must not be levered or inverse.
      li The component security must have over $5 million in assets.

    br
    a.view-on(href="#") View on Bloomberg:&nbsp;
      strong ETFCOMP
    a.view-on(href="#") View on Yahoo Finance:&nbsp;
      strong ^ETFCOMP

    br
